Hi Asia,

If you don’t use new data to predict, you aren’t controlling for all variables that go into the prediction. Coyote occupancy (cond. on fawn) is dependent on both DISTED and REG according to your model. Without specifying new data, the function grabs the data from your unmarked frame and so is showing coyote occupancy as disted changes for both values of REG.

Jennifer

